{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24670","headline":"不与老爲期 · 白居易","name":"不与老爲期","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不与老爲期，因何两鬓丝。\n才应免夭促，便已及衰羸。\n昨夜梦何在，明朝身不知。\n百忧非我所，三乐是吾师。\n闭目常闲坐，低头每静思。\n存神机虑息，养气语言迟。\n行亦携诗箧，眠多枕酒巵。\n自慙无一事，少有不安时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24670.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24670","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}